<title>POLAND: WEDEL MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>WEDEL MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.68 vs   2.87</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.98 vs   3.77</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.70 vs   2.74</p>
<p> Sales		   59.83 vs  52.76</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    15.77 vs   9.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	23.09 vs  12.21</p>
<p> Operating profit    21.07 vs   9.13</p>
<p> Sales		  295.83 vs 249.11</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectioner is Wedel SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
